window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Things aren’t so wonderful in the Seven Kingdoms of Heaven</b>.<br> <br> Meg finds out Sparrow has a sister. A beautiful and deranged sister that Sparrow's family is keeping locked in the basement. And now, they're locked up together while Sparrow attempts to make amends with family.</p> <p>Meg and Sparrow might be invincible together, but Meg is having a hard time getting along with Sparrow's father.<br> <br> Meg promised on Sparrow’s life not to leave, but Sparrow’s acting a little…strange. Again. The daughter of an Archangel and the Devil’s spawn should know better than to expect two tickets to paradise without complications. But sometimes falling in love can change a world-weary country girl. Sometimes following your heart means losing your mind.<br> <br> <i>*This is book 2 in the Veil of Shadows Series, but you can start here if you'd like.*</i></p>"; 
